WEBVTT

00:02:28.857 --> 00:02:33.172
He senses he is dying.

00:02:33.172 --> 00:02:35.690
He didn't die.

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:39.006
His right eye left him.

00:02:39.006 --> 00:02:42.591
His fiancée left him.

00:02:42.591 --> 00:02:46.691
His landlord, the mini-mart owner,
kicked him out.

00:02:46.691 --> 00:02:52.004
Soon he was homeless and 
60,000 dollars in medical debt,

00:02:52.004 --> 00:02:56.206
including a fee for dialing 
for an ambulance.

00:02:57.996 --> 00:03:00.458
But Raisuddin lived.